# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audit-campaign scratch (2026-07/08). All patterns below are ROOT-ANCHORED
# with a leading "/" so they can never match a real source or test file in a
# subdirectory. Verified: `git ls-files` matches none of these.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Scratch probes and per-agent cache dirs: tmp-*.ts, tmp-*.cjs, tmp-<agent>-cache/
# Root-anchored on purpose -- an unanchored "tmp-*" would also swallow
# tests/cts/tmp-neg/, and nothing under tests/ may be ignored.
/tmp-*

# Created by a bad CTS_CACHE_DIR interpolation (a literal "d" directory,
# from an unexpanded /d/... path). ~200 files.
/d/

# Release build tree (the Debug tree "build/" is already ignored above).
/build-release/

# Probe/scratch output directories
/ZZZ/
/.probe/
/.deno/

# Loose scratch files at the repo root
/hostile-probe.ts
/.scan-run.sh
/sr.bat
/ro.txt
/plain.txt

# MSVC debug symbols and Node tracing output
*.pdb
/node_trace.*.log
# Dotfile scratch probes from the same campaign (root-anchored).
/.tmp-*

# Per-agent pre-edit backups (never source of truth; the tree is).
*.bak-*
